2026-07-27T14:44:17.8068236Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:44:17.8068780Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:44:17.8069596Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:44:17.8070540Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
